{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852741576237121561","content":"\"Well they rose to prominence relatively near here, and the most adherents on the west coast. It was actually one of their followers to first fully coalesce the order of arachne into what it is now. There's some talk about how old they actually are and whether or not only their prominence is recent or they themselves became a god only recently, but i digres...\"","created_at":"2021-07-18T01:58:16.706000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866136764528066590","reply_to_id":"866115331088187442","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852741576237121561","content":"She sighs lightly. \"Well I can tell you for starters that it won't be quite so simple as forgetting it. That rage has been a part of you\" she points one of her 6 long legs at your heart \"it has even been simply you. it will require much work. Are you prepared to do this?\"","created_at":"2021-07-18T02:00:19.710000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866137280444235836","reply_to_id":"866124194831007754","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Boggman","id":"860303482065256448","is_bot":0,"username":"boggman1"},"author_id":"860303482065256448","channel_id":"852741576237121561","content":"\"What must I do?\"","created_at":"2021-07-18T02:01:34.828000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866137595510652988","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852741576237121561","content":"\"You will have to train, meditate, and devote much of your time and energy to understanding and then parting with your rage. Some of that will be done under me here, some may be done on your own time, and some may also be done under one of those who frequents this temple. Do you know what you will be working to replace that rage with? because a hole like that must be filled. Will you be a priest of the natural, a priest of the dark and decitful, or a warrior-priest?\" (those last 3 correspond to life cleric, trickery cleric, and paladin of arachne respectively)","created_at":"2021-07-18T02:05:58.090000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866138699711774750","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Boggman","id":"860303482065256448","is_bot":0,"username":"boggman1"},"author_id":"860303482065256448","channel_id":"852741576237121561","content":"\"I choose to be a warrior priest. So I can stand on the front lines and protect what's important to me and the balance of nature.\"","created_at":"2021-07-18T02:08:17.856000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866139285933523005","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852741576237121561","content":"She nods. \"Then you will be able to train under Carin. I believe you two have met?\"","created_at":"2021-07-18T02:08:51.403000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866139426638528522","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Boggman","id":"860303482065256448","is_bot":0,"username":"boggman1"},"author_id":"860303482065256448","channel_id":"852741576237121561","content":"\"Yes. We have met before.\"","created_at":"2021-07-18T02:09:54.730000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-18T02:10:10.001000Z","id":"866139692251873311","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852741576237121561","content":"She smiles. \"Well then. I imagine it will take you a cumulative 24 hours of work to let go of your rage, though you will likely need my help for the final step.\" she leans forward and kisses you on the forehead. \"May your path be true and your heart be steadfast, my child.\" She will then take you outside to begin your training.","created_at":"2021-07-18T02:13:29.512000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866140593113661470","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852741576237121561","content":"(you will need to have thomas do a total of 24 hours of training/meditation before his class can change. you may not do anything else during this time, though it may overlap with up to two hours of each long rest and all of your short rests. Ping me whenever you complete a set of hours, and i'll keep a tally here of how long has elapsed. When you reach 24 hours, return here and you will lose your barbarian level for a paladin one. that all make sense?)","created_at":"2021-07-18T02:13:35.689000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866140619022139442","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
